      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A high percentage of patients undergoing coronary angiography which revealed no coronary lesions persists among patients with stable CHD. This problem persists in spite of the application of existing recommendations for the management of patients with stable CHD. Data of Russian and foreign authors analyzed in this article, which dedicated to this subject."},
